-pele-bicycle-kick-scan-v3-640.webp 640w, /uploads/rency-pele-bicycle-kick-scan-v3.webp 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 780px\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/rency-pele-bicycle-kick-scan-v3.webp\"\n                alt=\"Pelé Bicycle Kick The King, Rency Art two-dollar bill, obverse above and reverse below\"\n                width=\"1440\"\n                height=\"1196\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; object-fit:contain; background:#fff;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Enlarge\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) &mdash; Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">United States</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Artist</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Rency</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Title</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">The King Pele — &ldquo;The Beautiful Game&rdquo;<span style=\"display:block; margin-top:6px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331;\">El Rey Pelé — &ldquo;El juego bonito&rdquo;</span></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Year</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">2024</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Medium</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Fine-art giclée on a genuine legal-tender two-dollar bill (<em>Fine Art Giclée on Genuine $2 U.S. Bill</em>)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Face Value</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">$2.00 (two dollars — U.S. legal tender)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensions</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Approx. 6&quot; &times; 2.5&quot; (152 &times; 64 mm)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Edition</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Hand-signed by the artist Rency</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Signature</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Personally hand-signed by Rency</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Classification</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Rency Art / contemporary exonumia — <em>not</em> a bank issue catalogued in Pick or Friedberg</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"></div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"rency-pele-bicycle-kick-scan\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button data-zoom-close aria-label=\"Close\" style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\">&times;</button>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Zoom out\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button disabled=\"false\" data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); touch-action:none;\">\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/rency-pele-bicycle-kick-scan-v3.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img data-zoom-image src=\"/uploads/rency-pele-bicycle-kick-scan-v3.webp\" alt=\"Pelé — Bicycle Kick “The King” — enlarged view\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">About the Work</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">Recognized as one of the greatest players of all time, Pelé ranks among the most successful and beloved sports figures of the twentieth century. This <strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Rency Art</strong> piece honors that legacy with an iconic bicycle kick printed as a giclée on a genuine two-dollar bill.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">Among football’s spectacular goals, none outranks the bicycle kick. The airborne acrobatics go beyond the game itself: a gesture as incredible as it is demanding. Perhaps none is more famous than Pelé’s iconic strike, captured during a 1965 friendly between Brazil and Belgium, where the player seems to defy gravity, suspended upside down, the ball leaving his extended leg at a perfect 90-degree angle.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">Vibrant pop-art graffiti colors decorate this genuine two-dollar bill, combining the subversive spirit of <em>street art</em> with officially recognized legal tender. The piece is <strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">hand-signed by Rency</strong>, an anonymous artist working in the wake of other well-known urban graffiti writers.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">Notofilia’s giclée note is preserved in perfect condition. These works are often shown in a clear display holder (approx. 6&quot; &times; 3&quot;) to protect and present the piece.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Obverse</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Pelé’s bicycle kick:</strong> pop-art intervention of the iconic overhead kick on the standard U.S. two-dollar design (portrait of Thomas Jefferson).</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">&ldquo;The King&rdquo; / &ldquo;The Beautiful Game&rdquo;:</strong> legends from the official title of the work, evoking Pelé’s nickname and football’s classic phrase.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Pop-art graffiti colors:</strong> an intense palette overprinted by giclée on the original intaglio design of the legal-tender note.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Reverse</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Artist’s signature:</strong> hand-signed by Rency on the reverse of the note.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Original support:</strong> standard reverse of the federal two-dollar bill (engraving of the Declaration of Independence), partly visible under the artistic intervention.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Sources</h2>\n            <ul style=\"margin:0; padding:0 0 0 20px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n              <li>Descriptive material from the original distributor of the The King Pelé Rency Art $2 Bill edition</li>\n              <li>Notofilia.com private collection</li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n</div>\n"
    }
